{"path":"chrono/c/tm","title":"std::tm","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>tm","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/c/tm","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Structure holding a calendar date and time broken down into its components.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ctime\">&lt;ctime&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> tm<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Structure holding a calendar date and time broken down into its components.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_objects\">Member objects</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-dsc-small\">int</span> tm_sec</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  seconds after the minute – <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-until-cxx11\"><span><span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">61</span></span></code><code>]</code></span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></span></span> <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx11\"><span><span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">60</span></span></code><code>]</code></span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></span></span